		<section deliveryTarget="except_digital">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>Grab the cover handle and lift the cover to use luggage tray.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>There are 4 luggage net holders located in the cargo area.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul id="e01652">
				<li>
					<p>Grab the cover handle and lift the cover to use luggage tray.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>There are 4 luggage net holders located in the cargo area.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<note type="warning">
				<p>Avoid eye injury. Do not overstretch the luggage net, Always keep your face and body out of the luggage net’s recoil path. Do not use when the strap has visible signs of wear or damage.</p>
			</note>
			<note type="caution">
				<p>To prevent damage to the goods or the vehicle, care should be taken when carrying fragile or bulky objects in the luggage compartment.</p>
			</note>
		</section>
